Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.96,0:09:38.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}给小孩取这种名字  长大了还能做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.55,0:09:43.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Anyway, when he left he forgot to take the poem with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.55,0:09:43.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}总之  他走的时候忘了把这首诗带走
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.83,0:09:48.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I am totally dense about poetry, but I think this is pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.83,0:09:48.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我完全看不懂诗  不过我觉得这是一首好诗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.37,0:09:49.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.37,0:09:49.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们看看
