Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.42,0:10:05.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, I think so too. Phoebe?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.42,0:10:05.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对  我也觉得  菲比
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.78,0:10:07.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Great! I'm so glad you guys like it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.78,0:10:07.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太棒了  我真高兴你们都喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.70,0:10:09.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- I gotta go to work. - I'm not done.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.70,0:10:09.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我得去上班了  -还没看完呢
