Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.00,0:10:18.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, my God! Oh, my God! Poor Monica!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.00,0:10:18.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的天  可怜的莫妮卡
