Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.39,0:10:19.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.17,0:10:23.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What? He was with her when he wrote this poem!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.17,0:10:23.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}怎么了  他在跟她亲热时写这首诗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.28,0:10:26.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"My vessel so lovely, with nothing inside"?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.28,0:10:26.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的花瓶如此美丽  内里空无一物
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.68,0:10:29.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"Now that I've touched you, you seem emptier still"?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.68,0:10:29.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如今我伸手触摸  你看似更加空洞
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.80,0:10:33.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He thinks Monica's empty. She's the empty vase!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.80,0:10:33.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他觉得莫妮卡很空洞  她是个空花瓶
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.60,0:10:35.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You really think that's what he meant that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.60,0:10:35.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你真的觉得他是这个意思吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.55,0:10:36.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Totally.
