Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.76,0:10:39.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}老天  她看起来好幸福
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.79,0:10:40.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Done.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.79,0:10:40.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看完了
